SuperMimic Go2

This repository extracts the Go2 velocity-control extension from
https://github.com/Huangw-NKU/supermimic_vibed, including the local Go2
extension developed in that working tree.

The original SuperMimic reproduction and shared rotation utilities carry
the MIT license reproduced in LICENSE, including the original copyright
notice for ETH Zurich and Chong Zhang. This is an unofficial implementation
and a quadruped extension, not an official SuperMimic release.

Isaac Lab, Newton, MuJoCo, MuJoCo Warp, and Unitree robot assets are external
dependencies. They retain their respective licenses and notices; they and
their assets are not redistributed in this source repository. Installing
them does not relicense them under this repository's MIT license.
